--
-- Canonical form: the session's client_encoding doesn't affect what is
-- stored, and two databases holding the same content have the same root
-- hash although their objects have different OIDs (objects are identified
-- by name in canonical form, never by OID).
--
\set ECHO none
commit start|t
branch latin1|t
branch utf8|t
branch other|t
checkout latin1|t
commit latin1|t
checkout utf8|t
commit utf8|t
same root across client encodings|t
checkout other|t
commit other|t
other content: different root|t
back to main|t
different oids|t
same root across databases|t
other content: different root|t
